technology of freezing (human) *eggs*.  I've never seen this topic 
come up here before, presumably due to the small female population
on this list. Nonetheless it's important.  Is freezing one's eggs a
possible option for a healthy woman aged puberty-35 today if she 
doesn't want to have children now, but may want to in 10-20 years?  
Unlike male semen, women's eggs are formed at birth, and age.  The older
